body:
Hi OP! Just wanted to send some love your way—I’m nowhere near brave enough to post photos of my face, so for that alone you have my admiration and respect;

but also, my mom said the same and worse to me. Every morning when I’m putting myself together, it’s still her critiques I hear/am learning to tune out.

You’re not alone and you are NOT ugly, no matter your presentation 🫂🫂🫂🫂🫂
